  "plain": "AARO, the Pentagon office set up in the 2020s to investigate UAP (the newer official term for UFOs), hired a company called SANCorp. The firm specializes in insider-threat protection and stopping whistleblower leaks. That is according to UAPGerb, an online researcher known by that handle, who tells Michels that a man named Tim Phillips said on a podcast that SANCorp was hired to connect AARO with subject-matter experts. UAPGerb presents this as a sign that the office was guarding against leaks rather than just gathering expertise."
